**Design choices beyond the plan**, recorded in report §6.4: an instance-free degree via `Set.ncard` so that intermediate graphs in induction need no decidability instance; R1 on the degree sum instead of the edge count; `isolateSet` defined directly with the fold recovered as a lemma; R4 proved by induction on the sequence, since the finset-first induction the plan sketched does not go through as written; R6 skipped as optional.

